      "responseContract": "appcall-provider-json-v1",
      "adaptations": [
        "Credential-only healthcheck maps to GET /accounts/{accountId}/tokens/verify from the pinned validator, using the required stored accountId on the fixed host api.cloudflare.com (Algolia-style stored id, not a caller-supplied host).",
        "Native category is dev-tools (source Developer Tools/Data; security/data are not both in Rust CATEGORIES).",
        "HTTP 200 bodies with a populated errors array are demoted via bodyErrorPaths [errors]. success is not used because true would false-fail.",
        "The upstream user-agent is not sent. OAuth2 is omitted; this recipe is API-token only."
      ]
    },
